{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 2, "text": "宋经验的基础上，又有新的发展。鉴于羁縻州制虽命以郡县之名，实同独立王国。为加", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 257, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "宋经验的基础上，又有新的发展。鉴于羁縻州制虽命以郡县之名，实同独立王国。为加", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 257, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 3, "text": "强中央王朝的控制，采取蒙夷参治之法，而官有土流之分，于是始有土司之名。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 318, "w": 1355, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "强中央王朝的控制，采取蒙夷参治之法，而官有土流之分，于是始有土司之名。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 318, "w": 1355, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 4, "text": "土司制的官职，计有宣慰、宣抚、安抚长官诸司。这些职名，元代布依族地区均已齐", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 386, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "土司制的官职，计有宣慰、宣抚、安抚长官诸司。这些职名，元代布依族地区均已齐", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 386, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 5, "text": "备。至明、清时，土司制更臻完善。土司是辖区内的最高统治者，又是当地的封建领主。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 455, "w": 1548, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "备。至明、清时，土司制更臻完善。土司是辖区内的最高统治者，又是当地的封建领主。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 455, "w": 1548, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 6, "text": "他们拥有士兵，掌握生杀大权，设有衙门、监狱、公堂、神祠等统治机构，对内自用其法，定", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 515, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "他们拥有士兵，掌握生杀大权，设有衙门、监狱、公堂、神祠等统治机构，对内自用其法，定", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 515, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 7, "text": "期向中央朝贡。虽然清雍正年间强行“改土归流”，大部分地区换上外地流官治理，但土", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 575, "w": 1548, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "期向中央朝贡。虽然清雍正年间强行“改土归流”，大部分地区换上外地流官治理，但土", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 575, "w": 1548, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 8, "text": "司制仍在一些偏僻地区延续至民国初年。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 648, "w": 716, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "司制仍在一些偏僻地区延续至民国初年。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 648, "w": 716, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 9, "text": "四、半殖民地半封建社会时期", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 712, "w": 503, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "四、半殖民地半封建社会时期", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 712, "w": 503, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 10, "text": "布依族地区的半殖民地半封建社会开始于1840年鸦片战争。", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 776, "w": 1065, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族地区的半殖民地半封建社会开始于1840年鸦片战争。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 776, "w": 1065, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 11, "text": "就布依族而言，这一时期有如下特点：", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 841, "w": 655, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "就布依族而言，这一时期有如下特点：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 841, "w": 655, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 12, "text": "从经济方面看，是外国商品和资本的涌入，对布依族自给自足的经济和手工业产生", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 901, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "从经济方面看，是外国商品和资本的涌入，对布依族自给自足的经济和手工业产生", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 901, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 13, "text": "了冲击。", "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 970, "w": 145, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "了冲击。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 96, "y": 970, "w": 145, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 14, "text": "布依族长期以自给自足的农业经济为主，但据摩经的记载，布依族的商品交换出现", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1030, "w": 1467, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族长期以自给自足的农业经济为主，但据摩经的记载，布依族的商品交换出现", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1030, "w": 1467, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 15, "text": "得很早。汉文献所说夜郎地区“耕田，有邑聚”，表明当时已经有了用于商品交换的集市。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1098, "w": 1552, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "得很早。汉文献所说夜郎地区“耕田，有邑聚”，表明当时已经有了用于商品交换的集市。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1098, "w": 1552, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 16, "text": "根据记载，夜郎的商业活动北通巴蜀，南通南越、交趾。摩经中的《安王与祖王》、《登仙", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1163, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "根据记载，夜郎的商业活动北通巴蜀，南通南越、交趾。摩经中的《安王与祖王》、《登仙", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1163, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 17, "text": "经》、《送仙经》、《嘱咐经》等关于商业活动的记载比比皆是。鸦片战争以前，以十二生肖", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1223, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "经》、《送仙经》、《嘱咐经》等关于商业活动的记载比比皆是。鸦片战争以前，以十二生肖", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1223, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 18, "text": "命名的集市遍布布依族地区，布依语称为“给“［ke'］或“结”［tge*］，汉语称“场”。到集", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1287, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "命名的集市遍布布依族地区，布依语称为“给“［ke'］或“结”［tge*］，汉语称“场”。到集", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1287, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 19, "text": "市交易，汉语称“赶场”，布依语称“蒿给“［hau”ke'］或“蒿结”［hau’tce'］。布依语与汉语", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1352, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "市交易，汉语称“赶场”，布依语称“蒿给“［hau”ke'］或“蒿结”［hau’tce'］。布依语与汉语", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1352, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 20, "text": "没有同源或借用关系，说明是布依语的固有词。商品交易用词“该”［kaxi］（卖）、“驶”", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1420, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "没有同源或借用关系，说明是布依语的固有词。商品交易用词“该”［kaxi］（卖）、“驶”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1420, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 21, "text": "［su”］（买）也是固有词，只有街道的“街”借用了汉语词，布依语按汉语西南官话读为", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1485, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "［su”］（买）也是固有词，只有街道的“街”借用了汉语词，布依语按汉语西南官话读为", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1485, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 22, "text": "［kari］。布依族受汉文化影响较深，表现在语言中就是布依语中有诸多汉语借词。反映", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1553, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "［kari］。布依族受汉文化影响较深，表现在语言中就是布依语中有诸多汉语借词。反映", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1553, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 23, "text": "商品交换的词固有词，说明在接受汉文化影响之前，布依族社会中就早已有了商业活", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1617, "w": 1544, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "商品交换的词固有词，说明在接受汉文化影响之前，布依族社会中就早已有了商业活", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1617, "w": 1544, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 24, "text": "动。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1682, "w": 68, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "动。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1682, "w": 68, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 25, "text": "布依族中的商业，除了交换剩余农产品、食品和畜禽之外，还有手工业制品，包括生", "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1746, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族中的商业，除了交换剩余农产品、食品和畜禽之外，还有手工业制品，包括生", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 177, "y": 1746, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 26, "text": "产工具、生活用具以及玩具，等等。黔南平塘、荔波一带的篾器、瓷器，贞丰一带的布依布", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1806, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "产工具、生活用具以及玩具，等等。黔南平塘、荔波一带的篾器、瓷器，贞丰一带的布依布", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1806, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 27, "text": "（即所谓“土布”），等等，都是市场上的主打商品。", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1875, "w": 876, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（即所谓“土布”），等等，都是市场上的主打商品。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 1875, "w": 876, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 28, "text": "据考证，早在19世纪初期，布依族聚居的兴义、贞丰、普安等地，种棉农民不断增加，", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1943, "w": 1467, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "据考证，早在19世纪初期，布依族聚居的兴义、贞丰、普安等地，种棉农民不断增加，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1943, "w": 1467, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 29, "text": "种棉面积逐步扩大。19世纪中期，安顺、都匀等地从河南、湖北等地引进良种，促进了棉", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2008, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "种棉面积逐步扩大。19世纪中期，安顺、都匀等地从河南、湖北等地引进良种，促进了棉", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2008, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 30, "text": "花生产。北盘江两岸地区主要居住着布依族，因地处亚热带，适宜于种植棉花，因此有", "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2072, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "花生产。北盘江两岸地区主要居住着布依族，因地处亚热带，适宜于种植棉花，因此有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 92, "y": 2072, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 38, "line_no": 31, "text": "“花山”之称。布依族种棉花除了满足自用外，还作为商品出售给安顺一带的纺织业者。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2132, "w": 1552, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“花山”之称。布依族种棉花除了满足自用外，还作为商品出售给安顺一带的纺织业者。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2132, "w": 1552, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
